      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MOSS-Image Edit (native ComfyUI)\n\nEdits images with the [Moss-Image-Edit](https://huggingface.co/chinoll/Moss-Image-Edit) LoRA on ComfyUI's native MOSS-Image, using the nodes from [ComfyUI-Moss-Image-Edit-Native](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Moss-Image-Edit-Native).\n\n**Models**\n\n- `diffusion_models`: [moss_image_sft_bf16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors) or [moss_image_sft_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `loras`: [moss_image_edit_lora_bf16](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Moss-Image-Edit-ComfyUI/resolve/main/moss_image_edit_lora_bf16.safetensors)\n- `text_encoders`: [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) (or a bf16 Qwen3.5-9B)\n- `vae`: [flux2-vae_small](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors) or flux2-vae (same encoder)\n\n**Use**\n\n- Load your image and describe the change.\n- References are resized to `reference_max_edge` (512, as the LoRA was trained); the output takes the size of image 1. Raise both for larger edits.\n- Upstream defaults: 30 steps, cfg 4, euler / simple, empty negative.\n- Example inputs: `example_inputs/` in the node pack, copy them to `ComfyUI/input`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MOSS-Image Edit (native ComfyUI)\n\nEdits images with the [Moss-Image-Edit](https://huggingface.co/chinoll/Moss-Image-Edit) LoRA on ComfyUI's native MOSS-Image, using the nodes from [ComfyUI-Moss-Image-Edit-Native](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Moss-Image-Edit-Native).\n\n**Models**\n\n- `diffusion_models`: [moss_image_sft_bf16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors) or [moss_image_sft_int8_convrot](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `loras`: [moss_image_edit_lora_bf16](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Moss-Image-Edit-ComfyUI/resolve/main/moss_image_edit_lora_bf16.safetensors)\n- `text_encoders`: [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) (or a bf16 Qwen3.5-9B)\n- `vae`: [flux2-vae_small](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors) or flux2-vae (same encoder)\n\n**Use**\n\n- Load your image and describe the change.\n- References are resized to `reference_max_edge` (512, as the LoRA was trained); the output takes the size of image 1. Raise both for larger edits.\n- Upstream defaults: 30 steps, cfg 4, euler / simple, empty negative.\n- Example inputs: `example_inputs/` in the node pack, copy them to `ComfyUI/input`."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
